            "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ITALY’S WORST RESTAURANT IS HIRING!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You and your friends are the team. Your job is to run the restaurant for the entire day. Preferably without poisoning anyone. While one of you cooks, the others prepare drinks, serve the customers, and deal with whatever goes wrong before it gets much worse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/617310/extras/cea28136b5031e731604552fcb68f663.poster.avif?t=1789558232\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/617310/extras/cea28136b5031e731604552fcb68f663.webm?t=1789558232\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/617310/extras/cea28136b5031e731604552fcb68f663.mp4?t=1789558232\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WELCOME TO 0.5 MICHELIN STARS!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customers expect food, drinks, and a timely service. Try to provide at least two of those.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/617310/extras/7cc08a78d35bf961c702e1bbfc548442.poster.avif?t=1789558232\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/617310/extras/7cc08a78d35bf961c702e1bbfc548442.webm?t=1789558232\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/617310/extras/7cc08a78d35bf961c702e1bbfc548442.mp4?t=1789558232\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MORE TROUBLE, MORE MONEY!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When taking orders, choose which customers to accept in the restaurant and which ones to &quot;fire&quot;. The bigger the payout, the more trouble it usually causes. Some customers are hard to please, and some orders start going wrong before you even turn on the stove.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/617310/extras/ea3b92a3c0fcffa1c9fc059a75778d72.poster.avif?t=1789558232\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/617310/extras/ea3b92a3c0fcffa1c9fc059a75778d72.webm?t=1789558232\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/617310/extras/ea3b92a3c0fcffa1c9fc059a75778d72.mp4?t=1789558232\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SAFETY IS OUR TOP-3 PRIORITY!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trouble can start anywhere during the shift. Keep customers under control, fix the restaurant, and do whatever it takes to stop one problem from turning into a full-blown disaster. Not every solution is elegant, and not every customer is worth pleasing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/617310/extras/dc93a0a925b8a954944b55e7321ee599.poster.avif?t=1789558232\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/617310/extras/dc93a0a925b8a954944b55e7321ee599.webm?t=1789558232\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/617310/extras/dc93a0a925b8a954944b55e7321ee599.mp4?t=1789558232\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MIND THE BACK ALLEY!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bad influences can make or break your day. Every business has to deal with shady characters. They might steal your stuff, kidnap your clients, or make offers you can't refuse. One bad choice can send the whole restaurant into chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/617310/extras/5349fa1043e27b68d4c3fa5a6da0c248.poster.avif?t=1789558232\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/617310/extras/5349fa1043e27b68d4c3fa5a6da0c248.webm?t=1789558232\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/617310/extras/5349fa1043e27b68d4c3fa5a6da0c248.mp4?t=1789558232\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online co-op with friends</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run the kitchen or work at the tables</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Physics-based customers, food, and restaurant chaos</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shady Characters in the back alley and offers you can't refuse</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throw garbage from the window to the garbage bins, like a true Italian</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Picky clients and high-paying orders</p></li></ul>",
